{"lines": ["How is MatPat connected to Napoleon?", "In twenty twenty-five, MatPat spoke at the Capitol beside Congresswoman Yvette Clarke, launching a caucus for creators.", "In twenty ten, Clarke stood with Speaker Nancy Pelosi at a press event on the Capitol steps.", "Also in twenty ten, Pelosi stood right behind Barack Obama as he signed his health care law.", "In two thousand nine, President Obama and Michelle met Queen Elizabeth the Second at Buckingham Palace.", "Back in nineteen thirty-nine, a young Princess Elizabeth posed with her grandmother, Queen Mary.", "In eighteen ninety-five, Mary sat beside Queen Victoria at Balmoral, holding her baby son, the future Edward the Eighth.", "How is Jesus connected to Roxy?", "In fourteen eighty-two, Perugino painted Jesus handing the apostle Peter the keys of heaven, on the Sistine Chapel wall.", "Peter is counted as the first pope, and the line runs unbroken to Pope Francis in twenty thirteen.", "In twenty seventeen, Pope Francis received President Donald Trump at the Vatican.", "In twenty twenty-five, at Pope Francis's funeral, Trump met Philippine president Bongbong Marcos.", "In twenty twenty-three, Marcos gave actress Vanessa Hudgens a Philippine tourism ambassador award.", "In twenty twelve, Hudgens toured Sydney with her Journey 2 co-star Josh Hutcherson.", "In twenty twenty-five, Hutcherson and his Five Nights at Freddy's co-star Piper Rubio took the stage at Comic-Con.", "Weeks later, Rubio posed at Halloween Horror Nights with the voice actor behind Freddy Fazbear.", "That December, he walked the Five Nights at Freddy's 2 premiere with his Security Breach co-star Marta Svetek.", "She is the voice of Roxy, the wolf animatronic in Five Nights at Freddy's: Security Breach.", "How is Charlemagne connected to Rin Itoshi?", "Raphael's workshop painted Pope Leo the Third crowning Charlemagne emperor in Rome in 800.", "Leo the Third was the 96th pope, and the line runs 170 more popes to Pope Francis.", "In twenty twenty-two, Pope Francis received Japan's prime minister Fumio Kishida at the Vatican.", "That July in Tokyo, Kishida counted down ten hundred days to Expo twenty twenty-five with Expo chairman Masakazu Tokura.", "In twenty twenty-three, Tokura launched Expo ticket sales with the band Fantastics, including singer Yusei Yagi.", "And in twenty twenty-six, Yagi played Rin Itoshi in the live-action Blue Lock movie."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.36], ["is", 0.36, 0.54], ["MatPat", 0.54, 1.06], ["connected", 1.06, 1.48], ["to", 1.48, 1.76], ["Napoleon?", 1.76, 2.16], ["In", 3.04, 3.12], ["2025,", 3.12, 3.48], ["MatPat", 4.08, 4.38], ["spoke", 4.38, 4.62], ["at", 4.62, 4.82], ["the", 4.82, 4.88], ["Capitol", 4.88, 5.16], ["beside", 5.16, 5.52], ["Congresswoman", 5.52, 6.18], ["Avet", 6.18, 6.56], ["Clark,", 6.56, 6.78], ["launching", 7.1, 7.32], ["a", 7.32, 7.5], ["caucus", 7.5, 7.66], ["for", 7.66, 7.98], ["creators.", 7.98, 8.26], ["In", 8.94, 9.0], ["2010,", 9.0, 9.36], ["Clark", 9.7, 9.94], ["stood", 9.94, 10.2], ["with", 10.2, 10.38], ["Speaker", 10.38, 10.64], ["Nancy", 10.64, 10.92], ["Pelosi", 10.92, 11.24], ["at", 11.24, 11.74], ["a", 11.74, 11.8], ["press", 11.8, 11.98], ["event", 11.98, 12.16], ["on", 12.16, 12.44], ["the", 12.44, 12.54], ["Capitol", 12.54, 12.8], ["steps.", 12.8, 13.1], ["Also", 13.76, 14.08], ["in", 14.08, 14.22], ["2010,", 14.22, 14.6], ["Pelosi", 14.82, 15.04], ["stood", 15.04, 15.36], ["right", 15.36, 15.78], ["behind", 15.78, 16.2], ["Barack", 16.2, 16.34], ["Obama", 16.34, 16.84], ["as", 16.84, 17.06], ["he", 17.06, 17.18], ["signed", 17.18, 17.44], ["his", 17.44, 17.62], ["healthcare", 17.62, 17.8], ["law.", 17.8, 18.16], ["In", 18.76, 18.82], ["2009,", 18.82, 19.5], ["President", 19.96, 20.2], ["Obama", 20.2, 20.5], ["and", 20.5, 20.84], ["Michelle", 20.84, 21.12], ["met", 21.12, 21.4], ["Queen", 21.4, 21.62], ["Elizabeth", 21.62, 21.9], ["II", 21.9, 22.34], ["at", 22.34, 22.7], ["Buckingham", 22.7, 22.86], ["Palace.", 22.86, 23.5], ["Back",